erest in realistic creation and complex operation of railway layouts, there is no alternative. If there is one thing missing in EEP, it is the opportunity to experience these EEP worlds from within. Which is what <strong>EEP TS Mission</strong> offers! <br>Experience at first hand the rich and realistic atmosphere of EEP by taking on the role of a train conductor, shunting engineer, crane operator or train dispatcher.",
